Can an artist change China?

2
00:13:08,571 --> 00:13:14,571
Ai Weiwei: Never Sorry is a documentary film directed by Alison Klayman.

3
00:19:42,857 --> 00:19:48,857
An account of the many tribulations that Chinese artist Ai Weiwei, known for his subversive art and political activism, endured between 2008 and 2011, from his
rise to world fame via the Internet to his highly publicized arrest due to his frequent and daring confrontations with the Chinese authorities.

